cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Analyzing EIC Simulation Output (ePIC tutorial)'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Stephen
    family-names: Kay
  - name: The ePIC Collaboration
abstract: >-
  An ePIC tutorial that shows new members how to locate, explore, and analyze the
  reconstructed simulation output produced by EICrecon, using ROOT, Python/uproot,
  RDataFrame, and PODIO based approaches. Built with The Carpentries Workbench.
keywords:
  - EIC
  - ePIC
  - EICrecon
  - analysis
  - ROOT
  - uproot
  - RDataFrame
  - PODIO
repository-code: 'https://github.com/eic/tutorial-analysis'
